		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Purple-scaled lizard-like fey with a chimpanzee face. Renowned for their innate ability to ruin arcane objects.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 1, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 shortsword - 3 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 0</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Gremlin Meddling</strong>. Six or more jinkins can concentrate on a magic object for 1 hour. Afterwards, the object gains a random curse. Only works on items without a curse.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
